{"unit_id":"CN-Mg__codex-link#card-zh","repo":"CN-Mg/codex-link","commit":"91462b464e07937369158b7ecd8a6bb1d366f8f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-codex-link 是一款面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的 Codex 会话控制插件。它通过 DSH 工具接口连接 Codex app-server，并在设置页提供联动面板。主要功能包括列出和切换 Codex 会话、发送指令并追踪执行过程、读取最终回答和用量、派遣独立子任务，以及选择默认工作区和操作方式。适合希望从 DSH 对话中驱动 Codex、查看任务进度或将工作交给独立 Codex 进程的用户。使用前需要本机已安装并登录 Codex CLI 或桌面端。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1057-1080","lib/tools.js:96-163","client.js:523-533"]}
{"unit_id":"CN-Mg__codex-link#card-en","repo":"CN-Mg/codex-link","commit":"91462b464e07937369158b7ecd8a6bb1d366f8f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-codex-link lets DSH control Codex sessions through registered tools and a settings panel. Users can switch sessions, send instructions, follow progress, retrieve answers and usage, and delegate separate tasks. Codex CLI or desktop must be installed and signed in.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1057-1080","lib/tools.js:96-163","client.js:523-533"]}
